   Sutherland, Chris, Univ St Andrews, Ctr Res Ecol \& Environm Modelling, St Andrews, Scotland.
   Hare, Darragh; Johnson, Paul J.; Droge, Egil, Univ Oxford, Dept Biol, Wildlife Conservat Res Unit, Oxford, England.
   Hare, Darragh, Cornell Univ, Dept Nat Resources \& Environm, Ithaca, NY USA.
   Linden, Daniel W., NOAA Natl Marine Fisheries Serv, Northeast Fisheries Sci Ctr, Woods Hole, MA USA.
   Montgomery, Robert A., Univ Oxford, Dept Biol, Oxford, England.
   Droge, Egil, Zambian Carnivore Programme, Mfuwe, Zambia.},
DOI = {10.1098/rspb.2023.1261},
